  "_comment": "Guard states that aibuild-lab/agent-native-os deployed to students before this repository became the guard's home (09-11-2026). Each record is one exact version of agent-native-os configs/secrets-guard.manifest.json on main: `files` are the canonical bytes its refresher downloaded from aibuild-lab/workshop-installer hooks/ at tag `ref` (commit `workshopInstallerTagCommit`), and `local_files` are the adapters it copied from agent-native-os scripts/ at `agentNativeOsCommit`; that refresher refused any file whose hash differed. The final state (secrets-guard-2026-09-08) is secrets-guard.legacy.identities.json and is not repeated. Reviewed bytes establish identity only: a receipt-free installation is attributed only when every version-distinct file of each client belongs to the same `ref`, and it still needs a separate human approval. refresh-guard.mjs pins this file's LF-normalized sha256 (COURSE_DEPLOYED_IDENTITIES_SHA256); change both in one reviewed pull request, and add a record only with its source commit proven.",
